<title>FRANCE: Indosuez sells BSNV to SNS Bank Nederland.</title>
<headline>Indosuez sells BSNV to SNS Bank Nederland.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque Indosuez said on Monday it had sold its 100 percent shareholding in its subsidiary Banque de Suez Nederland (BSNV) to SNS Bank Nederland.</p>
<p>SNS Bank Nederland is part of a diversified Dutch group active in banking, insurance and asset management, Indosuez said in a statement.</p>
<p>The sale follows a letter of intent signed in December 1996.</p>
<p>The name of BSNV will be modified to reflect its new ownership structure, Banque Indosuez said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
